"preset. UVtools supports 1 to 16. Powers of two (1, 2, 4, 8, 16) preserve "
"full-white pixels on repeated encoding; other counts quantize full white "
"below 255. Version 1 always uses one plane. This controls the file codec, "
"separately from raster smoothing."
