"layer images themselves are NOT changed; use the display mirroring options "
"above for that. Automatic keeps the value this slicer has always written for "
"each format. Change it only if your printer shows the print mirrored or "
"double-mirrored. Verify with a small asymmetric test print. Formats with a "
"single yes/no flag store any mirroring as 'yes' (NanoDLP: horizontal only)."
