msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r/GUI/LayerOperationCatalog_Batch3.cpp:57
msgid ""
"Pyramid reduces and enlarges the image again. UVtools 7.0 computes the "
"pyramid but never stores it, so there it changes nothing; this slicer "
"applies the described behaviour. Filter 2D uses the raw kernel values (they "
"are not normalised)."
msgstr ""

